twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/sysbadm1n/status/1883325763446874128\">https://x.com/sysbadm1n/status/1883325763446874128</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1883326125713354832</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1883326125713354832\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-01-26T01:28:33Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1883329662363082995":{"a":"<p>@JayZyski @sysbadm1n I had to chuckle one night they flew directly over my driveway after midnight. Squawking Cessna (they own). Flying at 1000ft w/ pilot in chase plane (same make) at 3000ft. They obviously were watching the ground with night vision. I pulled out my phone and the LED screen shutoff.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1883325762738221493\">https://x.com/i/status/1883325762738221493</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1883329662363082995</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1883329662363082995\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-01-26T01:42:36Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1883330123581227238":{"a":"<p>@JayZyski @sysbadm1n Like 15ft triangle with a little bump out the rear. On top of the bump is a red collision light. You can only see the light after it has passed you. It&#x27;s neatly tucked up on top of the body.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1883329662363082995\">https://x.com/i/status/1883329662363082995</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1883330123581227238</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1883330123581227238\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-01-26T01:44:26Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd>